{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Umbra Mortis",
    "steam_appid": 3365870,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365870/extras/fd3585d1d971ae8172dc8b54a3db69d9.avif?t=1750883551\" data-has-big width=800 height=297 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise up to your duty raven, foul magic has overtaken the beautiful city of Venice. We cannot let this stand. Venice must be purged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be tasked with going through the streets of the accursed city and erasing all that reeks of undeath. Serve well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365870/extras/111c3be5c2ff79f9c75f9580d9a250b9.avif?t=1750883551\" data-has-big width=800 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The streets are full of them, for the carnival was taking place. Pay no heed to the enemy's numbers, for you will prevail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An odious miasma hangs in the air and has transformed all the celebrators into mindless husks of what they once were, free them from this hell so that the city can live on and grow old.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task will take you  all the way to the church, where you must call the horde upon yourself and deliver our god's fury to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365870/extras/111c3be5c2ff79f9c75f9580d9a250b9.avif?t=1750883551\" data-has-big width=800 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The subjects of your divine violence will be tenacious and maddened with starvation, you must never let your guard down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the possession, their bodies have deformed beyond recognition. Beware of the large ones and the partially disolved especially.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This foul magic has made them resilient and formidable. It will be a battle hard-fought.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365870/extras/111c3be5c2ff79f9c75f9580d9a250b9.avif?t=1750883551\" data-has-big width=800 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be not afraid for you are well equipped. You have at your disposal our finest weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rifles we give you have been infused with prayer and the good will of our Lord, their bullets sear wicked flesh and purge evil souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our explosives carry in them the ashes of great saints, they tear skin and bone alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But most of all, we give you a blessed artifact, one passed down through our organization. It heals the wounds of the righteous and brutalizes any heretic in its way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We wish you good luck warriors, may the light guide thee well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365870/extras/111c3be5c2ff79f9c75f9580d9a250b9.avif?t=1750883551\" data-has-big width=800 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a 3 player coop PvE shooter where you play as members of a secret organization, Umbra Mortis. You will go through the city of Venice which is overrun by undead carnival-goers.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365870/extras/fd3585d1d971ae8172dc8b54a3db69d9.avif?t=1750883551\" data-has-big width=800 height=297 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise up to your duty raven, foul magic has overtaken the beautiful city of Venice. We cannot let this stand. Venice must be purged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be tasked with going through the streets of the accursed city and erasing all that reeks of undeath. Serve well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365870/extras/111c3be5c2ff79f9c75f9580d9a250b9.avif?t=1750883551\" data-has-big width=800 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The streets are full of them, for the carnival was taking place. Pay no heed to the enemy's numbers, for you will prevail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An odious miasma hangs in the air and has transformed all the celebrators into mindless husks of what they once were, free them from this hell so that the city can live on and grow old.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task will take you  all the way to the church, where you must call the horde upon yourself and deliver our god's fury to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365870/extras/111c3be5c2ff79f9c75f9580d9a250b9.avif?t=1750883551\" data-has-big width=800 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The subjects of your divine violence will be tenacious and maddened with starvation, you must never let your guard down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the possession, their bodies have deformed beyond recognition. Beware of the large ones and the partially disolved especially.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This foul magic has made them resilient and formidable. It will be a battle hard-fought.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365870/extras/111c3be5c2ff79f9c75f9580d9a250b9.avif?t=1750883551\" data-has-big width=800 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be not afraid for you are well equipped. You have at your disposal our finest weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rifles we give you have been infused with prayer and the good will of our Lord, their bullets sear wicked flesh and purge evil souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our explosives carry in them the ashes of great saints, they tear skin and bone alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But most of all, we give you a blessed artifact, one passed down through our organization. It heals the wounds of the righteous and brutalizes any heretic in its way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We wish you good luck warriors, may the light guide thee well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365870/extras/111c3be5c2ff79f9c75f9580d9a250b9.avif?t=1750883551\" data-has-big width=800 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a 3 player coop PvE shooter where you play as members of a secret organization, Umbra Mortis. You will go through the city of Venice which is overrun by undead carnival-goers.</p>",
    "short_description": "Rise children of the almighty and be guided to your salvation. You must trek a path of mud and blood, but if you walk it together, you will surely have enough strength to tear through these beasts. Grab two friends and shoot zombies in this Venice carnival inspired shooter.",
